<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: flesh berserk -->
  <FH_Berserk.label>血肉暴走</FH_Berserk.label>
  <!-- EN: The flesh beasts are driven into a frenzied berserk state. -->
  <FH_Berserk.description>血肉兽陷入狂暴状态。</FH_Berserk.description>
  <!-- EN: berserk -->
  <FH_Berserk.stages.berserk.label>狂暴</FH_Berserk.stages.berserk.label>
  
  <!-- EN: flesh undying -->
  <FH_FleshUndying.label>血肉不死</FH_FleshUndying.label>
  <!-- EN: Stored twisted flesh keeps the host from dying while the parasite rebuilds ruined tissue. -->
  <FH_FleshUndying.description>储存的扭曲肉会阻止宿主死亡，并由寄生体重塑破损组织。</FH_FleshUndying.description>
  
  <!-- EN: bastionmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.label>铁骸母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: This creature is parasitized by a bastionmeld. The fleshbeast grants it additional abilities, but also imposes significant costs.\n\nTwo parasitic weapon mounts are grafted onto the body, allowing the host to release an EMP pulse. -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.description>该生物被铁骸母兽所寄生，血肉兽为这个生物提供了额外的能力，但也为其带来了一些不小的代价。\n\n在体表嫁接两个寄生武器装备位，并允许释放EMP脉冲。</FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Left weapon mount -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWeaponMounts.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>左武器基座</FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWeaponMounts.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: Right weapon mount -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWeaponMounts.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>右武器基座</FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWeaponMounts.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: bastionmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.stages.bastionmeld_mutualism.label>铁骸母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Bastionmeld.stages.bastionmeld_mutualism.label>
  
  
  <!-- EN: dreadmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.label>惊惧母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: This creature is parasitized by a dreadmeld. The fleshbeast grants it additional abilities, but also imposes significant costs.\n\nThe host gains incredible regeneration, improved mining work, and a terror roar.\n\n-Meld beast tentacle -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.description>该生物被惊惧母兽所寄生，血肉兽为这个生物提供了额外的能力，但也为其带来了一些不小的代价。\n\n赋予不可思议的再生能力，强化采矿工作，并允许释放惊惧咆哮。\n\n-母兽触手</FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Left Bone Spike -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>左骨刺</FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: Right Bone Spike -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>右骨刺</FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: dreadmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.stages.dreadmeld_mutualism.label>惊惧母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Dreadmeld.stages.dreadmeld_mutualism.label>
  

  <!-- EN: fissionmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.label>裂殖母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: This creature is parasitized by a fissionmeld. The fleshbeast grants it additional abilities, but also imposes significant costs.\n\nThe host's twisted flesh capacity and regeneration are increased; flesh undying is sustained while enough twisted flesh is stored, and harmful conditions can be purged.\n\n-Meld beast tentacle -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.description>该生物被裂殖母兽所寄生，血肉兽为这个生物提供了额外的能力，但也为其带来了一些不小的代价。\n\n提升扭曲肉容量并提供再生；扭曲肉充足时维持血肉不死，并允许清除负面状态和伤口。\n\n-母兽触手</FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Left Bone Spike -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>左骨刺</FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: Right Bone Spike -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>右骨刺</FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: fissionmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.stages.fissionmeld_mutualism.label>裂殖母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Fissionmeld.stages.fissionmeld_mutualism.label>

  
  <!-- EN: furiousmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.label>暴怒母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: This creature is parasitized by a furiousmeld. The fleshbeast grants it additional abilities, but also imposes significant costs.\n\nThe host gains twisted flesh capacity, stronger armor, and regeneration.\n\n-Shield-claw tentacle -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.description>该生物被暴怒母兽所寄生，血肉兽为这个生物提供了额外的能力，但也为其带来了一些不小的代价。\n\n提供扭曲肉容量、护甲和再生能力。\n\n-盾爪触手</FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Shield Claw -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWithShield.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>盾爪触手</FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWithShield.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: Shield Claw -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWithShield.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>盾爪触手</FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.comps.HediffComp_ParasitismWithShield.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: furiousmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.stages.furiousmeld_mutualism.label>暴怒母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Furiousmeld.stages.furiousmeld_mutualism.label>
  

  <!-- EN: nexusmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.label>统合母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.label>
  <!-- EN: This creature is parasitized by a nexusmeld. The fleshbeast grants it additional abilities, but also imposes significant costs.\n\nThe host gains twisted flesh capacity and regeneration, and all friendly fleshbeasts are strengthened.\n\n-Meld beast tentacle -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.description>该生物被统合母兽所寄生，血肉兽为这个生物提供了额外的能力，但也为其带来了一些不小的代价。\n\n提供扭曲肉容量和再生能力，并强化所有友方血肉兽。\n\n-母兽触手</FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.description>
  <!-- EN: Left Spike -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>左骨刺</FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.0.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: Right Spike -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>右骨刺</FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.comps.HediffComp_Parasitism.tentacles.1.renderNode.debugLabel>
  <!-- EN: nexusmeld mutualism -->
  <FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.stages.nexusmeld_mutualism.label>统合母兽寄生</FH_Parasitism_Nexusmeld.stages.nexusmeld_mutualism.label>

  
  <!-- EN: devastating strike ready -->
  <FH_TitanDevastatingStrikeReady.label>毁灭重击已蓄力</FH_TitanDevastatingStrikeReady.label>
  <!-- EN: The next melee attack that hits will shatter everything. -->
  <FH_TitanDevastatingStrikeReady.description>下一次命中的近战攻击将会粉碎一切</FH_TitanDevastatingStrikeReady.description>
  
  <!-- EN: flesh unification -->
  <FH_Unification.label>血肉统合</FH_Unification.label>
  <!-- EN: The nexusmeld's psychic unity strengthens the flesh. Melee damage increased, incoming damage reduced. -->
  <FH_Unification.description>统合母兽的心灵力量强化了血肉。近战伤害提升，承受伤害降低。</FH_Unification.description>
  
</LanguageData>